[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4862.83, "timestamp": "01:21:02", "text": "おお、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4865.91, "timestamp": "01:21:05", "text": "箱を取ってください。ええ、それが私のWasです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4869.59, "timestamp": "01:21:09", "text": "彼のすぐ隣にいる人？知っている。ああ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4871.43, "timestamp": "01:21:11", "text": "それは私のものだと思う。多分。私はしません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4873.669, "timestamp": "01:21:13", "text": "知る。奇妙なコスプレ。あれはライオンだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4876.07, "timestamp": "01:21:16", "text": "キングのテーマ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4887.669, "timestamp": "01:21:27", "text": "ああ、あれは何だったの？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4889.83, "timestamp": "01:21:29", "text": "彼は変わった 彼は変わった ああ、走れ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4892.87, "timestamp": "01:21:32", "text": "走る。走れ、走れ、走れ、走れ。何てことだ。私たちは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4895.99, "timestamp": "01:21:35", "text": "彼の話は聞くに堪えない。彼はそれを理解している。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4896.923, "timestamp": "01:21:36", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "OH.MY.GOD"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4900.07, "timestamp": "01:21:40", "text": "ああ、彼は亡くなった。いや、あれは我々の物だった。私の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4902.709, "timestamp": "01:21:42", "text": "ダメだよ、チャド。少なくともソアスは死んだ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4906.229, "timestamp": "01:21:46", "text": "右？ああ、兄弟、彼は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4907.83, "timestamp": "01:21:47", "text": "ゾンビ。彼は死んでいない。つまり、彼は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4909.59, "timestamp": "01:21:49", "text": "彼の顔には私たちと一緒にいて、彼は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4912.39, "timestamp": "01:21:52", "text": "緑色のものを吐く。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4914.79, "timestamp": "01:21:54", "text": "ええ、彼は緑色のものを吐いていました。リマインダー"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4918.39, "timestamp": "01:21:58", "text": "エイリアンのプレデターのあなた。"}]